
@: cpu_latency executes for an unexpected longer period
=: cpu_latency is migrated among CPUs during runtime
-: cpu_latency is migrated among CPUs during scheduling time
#: cpu_latency scheduling is delayed
+: delayed wakeup from nanosleep detected by cpu_latency itself

